  data: {
    LLM: "1. Draw a card from the deck or 'steal' the previous discard.\n2. Stealing: You can call 'Chow' (only from the player to your left), 'Pung' or 'Kong' (from anyone).\n3. If you complete your 14th card, you call 'Mah Jong'.",
    Player: "1. Draw a card from the deck or 'steal' the previous discard.\n2. Stealing: You can call 'Chow' (only from the player to your left), 'Pung' or 'Kong' (from anyone).\n3. If you complete your 14th card, you call 'Mah Jong'.",
    objective: 'Form a valid 14-card hand consisting of four sets of three and one pair.',
    gameplay: "1. Draw a card from the deck or 'steal' the previous discard.\n2. Stealing: You can call 'Chow' (only from the player to your left), 'Pung' or 'Kong' (from anyone).\n3. If you complete your 14th card, you call 'Mah Jong'.",
    keyRules: [
      'Each player has 13 tiles; East (dealer) has 14 to start. Win by completing 14 tiles in four melds and one pair.',
      'Draw one tile from the wall or claim a discard to meld (Chow from left neighbor only; Pung or Kong from any). Then discard one tile.',
      'Melds: Pung (three identical), Kong (four identical), Chow (three same suit in sequence). Declare Mah Jong when the 14th tile completes the hand.',
